# Toggling the whole subtree of a three-level project collapses every level, and toggling again expands every level; with only the top expanded it collapses again.
file <<END
Top:
	- a
		- b
			- c
	- d
END
keys "
see ▌ Top: ▸ 4
keys "
see - c
keys "
hide - a
keys l
see - a ▸ 2
keys "
hide - a
quit
